request.description:
This endpoint will take in a file (excel, tsv, or csv) with columns `email`, `name` or `non_canon` (this column being the non-canon teacher's name), and `canon`. Furthermore it allows for optional `faculty` boolean column (use `true` or `false` values). For each row in the file, a unique `teacher` will be searched for with the given column fields. If a unique `teacher` is found its email, canon name and non-canon name will be updated. If one is not found then a new Teacher object will be created. If multiple teacher objects for a row then it will be marked skipped and marked as a failure.

Email field for a row can be left blank. Recommended to include the other two column fields.

Note, when a `Teacher` object is created/found, the names they are given will be stored in the `history` table to keep a record of who has had the most recent name.

Note, if a `Teacher` object can't be found by name in the `teacher` table, the endpoint will fall back to look for a name in the `history` table.

**Example file contents:**

| **email** | **name** | **canon** | **faculty** |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| [sandler@example.com](https://mailto:sandler@example.com) | Happy Gilmore | Sandler, Adam | false |
| [rick@example.com](https://mailto:rick@example.com) | Rick Roll | Astley, Rick |  |
|  | World cup champ | Messi | false |
| [sandler@example.com](https://mailto:sandler@example.com) | Rick Roll | Messi |  |

**Resulting Endpoint response:**

``` json
{
    "msg": "finished trying to update teachers",
    "success": [
        {
            "creation_status": false,
            "teacher": {
                "id": 125,
                "canon": "Sandler, Adam",
                "non_canon": "Happy Gilmore",
                "email": "sandler@example.com",
                "cpe": false,
                "csc": false,
                "faculty": false
            }
        },
        {
            "creation_status": false,
            "teacher": {
                "id": 126,
                "canon": "Astley, Rick",
                "non_canon": "Rick Roll",
                "email": "rick@example.com",
                "cpe": false,
                "csc": false,
                "faculty": false
            }
        },
        {
            "creation_status": false,
            "teacher": {
                "id": 113,
                "canon": "Messi",
                "non_canon": "World cup champ",
                "email": null,
                "cpe": false,
                "csc": false,
                "faculty": false
            }
        }
    ],
    "failed": [
        {
            "msg": "Multiple teacher entities with given fields",
            "attempt": {
                "canon": "Messi",
                "non_canon": "Rick Roll",
                "email": "sandler@example.com"
            }
        }
    ]
}

 ```

